       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-KINO-OTF.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-KINO-OTF-PROOFS.
           05  WS-AIRY-BOUNDS-OK           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-COMPLEX-OTF-OK           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-MTF-CONTRAST-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-KOTF-LATENCY-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-KOTF-SEAL-OK             PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-KINO-OTF-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-POF-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-POF-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-AIRY-AND-OTF.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-MTF-AND-LAT.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-POF-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-AIRY-AND-OTF.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-AIRY-BOUNDS-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-COMPLEX-OTF-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-MTF-AND-LAT.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-MTF-CONTRAST-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-KOTF-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-POF-PROOFS.
           IF WS-AIRY-BOUNDS-OK = 1 AND
              WS-COMPLEX-OTF-OK = 1 AND
              WS-MTF-CONTRAST-OK = 1 AND
              WS-KOTF-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-KOTF-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-POF-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-POF-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-POF-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-POF-CODE.
